# Vexa — review ownership.
#
# The LAST matching rule wins, so the global fallback must stay at the top:
# every rule below it overrides it. Moving `*` to the bottom would make the
# Team Lead the only reviewer for the whole repository.
#
# GitHub excludes the PR author from its own reviewer list. That is why every
# path has at least two owners — otherwise an owner's PR gets no reviewer and
# hangs forever. The only exception is /.github/, see the note at the bottom.

# Global fallback — Team Lead reviews everything by default
*                       @terekh373

# Backend: Team Lead + backend dev
/apps/api/              @terekh373 @suberbobbr

